        "text_Bijdcp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Founded by Creative Director, William Drury, Australian jewellery label WILLIAM ÉDOUARD aspires to use fine, handmade jewellery to enhance your inherent sense of personal style.<br/><br/>In pursuing his dream of creating fine works of art that both he and you can take pride in, William has studied both in Australia and overseas, with his work awarded for its technical excellence by master goldsmith and past president of the American Jewelry Design Council, Alan Revere.<br/><br/>'Finest craftsmanship, without compromise' is the cornerstone of William’s brand, with only the highest quality materials and ethically-sourced gemstones used throughout his process. Each WILLIAM ÉDOUARD piece is designed and handcrafted for you in our Melbourne studio with complete devotion to this philosophy.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
